  "summary": {
   "status": "complete",
   "text": "Bisignano predicted that AI would broadly reduce costs. He advocated incorporating AI into the phone system and said that AI use across processes would retain human responsibility for validating results. In his June 25, 2025 testimony, he described AI investments as supporting employee productivity and AI systems as part of efforts to prevent misuse and theft of Social Security numbers.",
